  "title": "· IN-BAG | FENDI Debuts Fall/Winter 2026 Bag Charms: Squirrel and Karl Lagerfeld Motifs ·",
  "original_title": "IN-BAG | FENDI 上市2026秋冬季新款包包挂饰：松鼠与老佛爷形象",
  "excerpt": "Fendi's Fall/Winter 2026 bag charms include the Squirrel, inspired by the founder's wife, and Karlito, a playful fur-accented tribute to Karl Lagerfeld.",
