      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "FENDI has just unveiled its new Fall/Winter 2026 bag charms — the \"Squirrel\" collection takes its cue from the nickname brand founder Edoardo Fendi gave his wife, while the \"Karlito\" collection offers a playful, cartoonish take on former artistic director Karl Lagerfeld, finished with mink and fox fur accents that make it equal parts cheeky and charming.",
