    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The little squirrel 🐿 was inspired by a painting Edoardo Fendi gave his wife, Adele Casagrande, because his beloved was always \"busy as a squirrel.\" Crafted from beige felt into an adorable squirrel figure, the charm's standout feature is its big tail, made from color-blocked mink fur that feels plush and silky to the touch.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
