      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The \"Karlito\" figure pays tribute to the brand's late former creative director, Karl Lagerfeld. Fashioned from calfskin and nappa lambskin, this charm captures the Kaiser's signature black-and-white look, with a tie accented by FENDI's Cuneo triangular studs — a detail inspired by the punctuation marks found on ancient Roman stone columns. Two zippered compartments, one at the front and one at the bottom, let you stash small essentials, making this piece as practical as it is good-looking.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
