    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This Karlito charm has a distinctly rock-and-roll edge, with long highlighted braids paired with a lavish fur coat for a look that's effortlessly cool and stylish. The piece is crafted from fox fur, mink fur, and Kidassia goat hair, combined with calfskin and lambskin, for a finish that's luxurious and refined.",
